# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of platform/local
# core.autocrlf settings. Without this, GitHub's windows-latest runner
# can check files out with CRLF, which makes `gofmt -l` (LF-only) flag
# every file as unformatted even though nothing is actually wrong
# (.github/workflows/test.yml's Windows `make check` job).
* text=auto eol=lf
